# t04-grep: the spec-correct behaviour of final.bzl, from the recorded final run (data/final-outputs.txt).

[case -i beta]
args: -i beta
stdin:
| alpha
| Beta
| gamma
| betamax
stdout:
| 2:Beta
| 4:betamax

[case -v a]
args: -v a
exit: 1
stdin:
| alpha
| Beta
| gamma
| betamax
stdout:

[case ]
exit: 2
stdin:
| alpha
| Beta
| gamma
| betamax
stdout:
stderr:
| usage: grep [-i] [-v] PATTERN
